<title>CHINA: China beer output rises 5.45 pct in Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>China beer output rises 5.45 pct in Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 13.71 million tonnes of beer in the first nine months, up 5.45 percent compared with the year-ago period, the State Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>China's beer output totalled 15.46 million tonnes in 1995, a rise of 10.8 percent over the previous year, official figures showed.</p>
